==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has not only reached 70 million downloads worldwide, but surpassed 77.77 million downloads!<br>
A limited-time campaign will be held to commemorate this!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Scheduled for October 3rd (11:00) to October 17th (10:59), 2022!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Get Platinum Shards every day! 77.77 million downloads login bonus is held!'''}}<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a {{Color|#0000FF|'''daily present of 1 Platinum Shard!'''}}<br>
Play the game every day, GET Platinum Shards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Schedule for October 11th (11:00) to October 17th (23:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Get lots of XP! "Super Guerrilla XP Special" is held!'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, lots of guerrilla XP stages where you can get lots of XP appear!

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・"XP Stage" appearance schedule"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/3, 10/5, 10/7, 10/9, 10/11, 10/13, 10/15】・・・11：00～13：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/4, 10/6, 10/8, 10/10, 10/12, 10/14, 10/16】・・・19：00～21：59'''}}

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・"XP Megablitz!" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/4, 10/6, 10/8, 10/10, 10/12, 10/14, 10/16】・・・11：00～13：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/3, 10/5, 10/7, 10/9, 10/11, 10/13, 10/15】・・・19：00～21：59'''}}

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・"XP Colosseum" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/5, 10/8, 10/11, 10/14, 10/17】・・・8：00～8：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/3, 10/6, 10/9, 10/12, 10/15】・・・16：00～16：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/4, 10/7, 10/10, 10/13, 10/16】・・・22：00～22：59'''}}

{{Color|#00BAFF|'''・"Merciless XP! appearance schedule"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/7, 10/10】・・・8：00～8：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/5, 10/14】・・・16：00～16：59'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''【10/3, 10/12】・・・22：00～22：59'''}}

Take this opportunity to play the stages and get XP!

<small>※In addition the above schedule, "XP Stage" and "XP Megablitz!" will also appear as normal.<br>
※"XP Megablitz!" is playable after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3, "XP Colosseum" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1, "Merciless XP!" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 3.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●"Builder's Blitz" Event!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect materials needed for Cat Base development!<br>
The special stages {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Cavern of Comets", "Island of Ash" and "Strait of Wings"'''}} will appear at the following times during the event period!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00～8:59 / 12:00～13:59 / 18:00～19:59 / 22:00～23:59'''}}

Take on this challenge each day, get lots of building materials!

<small>※All stages are playable after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1.<br>
※"Cavern of Comets", "Island of Ash" and "Strait of Wings" will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the times listed above.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●"Treasure Fest☆Festival" is held!'''}}<br>
A limited-time {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Festival'''}} will be held throughout the period, with a significant increase in Treasure drop rates!<br>
During the campaign period, it will be held on {{Color|#008000|'''even-numbered days (10/4, 10/6, 10/8, 10/10, 10/12, 10/14, 10/16)'''}} in the {{Color|#008000|'''"Japan Arc"'''}} and {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd-numbered days (10/3, 10/5, 10/7, 10/9, 10/11, 10/13, 10/15, 10/17)'''}} in the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Future Arc"'''}}!<br>

Plus, it will also be held in the {{Color|#0000FF|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}}！<br>
The {{Color|#0000FF|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}} Treasure Festival will be held on {{Color|#0000FF|'''10/5, 10/8, 10/11, 10/14, 10/17'''}}!<br>
<small>※"Japan Arc" and "Future Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1, "Cosmos Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited-time areas appear in "GAMATOTO Expedition!"'''}}<br>
The limited-time areas {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Grand XP Harvest（Easy・Normal・Hard）" and "Cats Eye Cave"'''}} appear in "GAMATOTO Expedition!"<br>
Chance to get more Catseyes and XP than usual!<br>
Don't miss this opportunity!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・"Grand XP Harvest（Easy・Normal・Hard・Veteran）"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for October 3rd (11:00)to October 10th  (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・"Cats Eye Cave"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for October 10th (11:00) to October 17th (10:59)!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited campaign! "Catseye Limited Capsules" and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" appear!'''}}<br>
By tapping the buttons in the top left of the Cat Capsule screen, you can switch to the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Catseye Limited Capsules" and "Catfruit Limited Capsules"'''}}<br>
Take this chance to get lots of items and strengthen your characters!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・"Catseye Limited Capsules"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for October 3rd (11:00) to October 10th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・"Catfruit Limited Capsules"'''}}<br>
Scheduled for October 10th (11:00) to October 17th (10:59)!

<small>※"Catseye Limited Capsules" provide Catseyes and XP, while "Catfruit Limited Capsules" provide Catfruit, XP and various items.<br>
※"Catseye Limited Capsules" will appear at User Rank 1600 and above, and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" will appear in the Cat Capsules after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a
{{Color|#FF0000|'''daily 20 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!!

